Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day.
The table below counts the unique reports in the export through 4 October.

**Originally merged as one issue; now split for separate investigation.**
The shared parser reads month first for day-first tenants. Separately, booking-v3
prints a month-first hint while the form reads tenant-local input.

